+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0 */
+/* Implementation of a segmented queue of bio_vec[].
+ *
+ * Copyright (C) 2026 Red Hat, Inc. All Rights Reserved.
+ * Written by David Howells (dhowells@redhat.com)
